note Pillar of flame (tier III): ratios 2, 1, 1, 2, 5, 6 -> root, third, fifth again, so the cloud goes bigger instead: a major-7 chord,
note ten voices, drenched. Its weight is a second bass (synth3 brought up to C2, quiet) and the blazing roar, both low-passed; the flamethrower turn-on fires on lock.
